atistically adjusted for reporting delays and missing transmission category\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the denominator for the rate per 1,000 persons living with HIV was calculated by adding the number of new HIV diagnoses\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The denominators for the rates per 100,000 population were calculated using year-specific census or postcensus data\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Estimates include statistical adjustment that accounted for reporting delays, but not for incomplete reporting.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}